# Exact test IDs from smbtorture --list in Samba 4.17.12-Debian.
# Debian packages: 2:4.17.12+dfsg-0+deb12u4, pinned in test/Dockerfile.
# Add one full test ID per line. No suite names or patterns.
#
# M2 has no eligible credit tests. The manager decision on #188 keeps the
# 256-credit target. session_setup_credits_granted requires at least 8192,
# which is Samba's policy, not an MS-SMB2 rule or a promise of this server.
# The Go credit tests gate M2 instead.
#
# Enumerated credit tests, all excluded:
# smb2.credits.session_setup_credits_granted.session_setup_credits_granted
# smb2.credits.single_req_credits_granted.single_req_credits_granted
# smb2.credits.skipped_mid.skipped_mid
# The last two require CREATE and also expect 8192 credits.
# Source: samba-4.17.12/source4/torture/smb2/credits.c in samba-team/samba.
